      "seed": 975688427,
      "version": 1126,
      "versionNonce": 1210324139,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789935368529,
      "created": 1789934288707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requirements\n1. Users should be able to run programs\n    Programs can be in various languages like python, C++, Java.\n\n2. System runs the program, report failures or success.\n-------\n3. Capture memory and time taken by the program and build histogram for users.\n\n\nNon functional requirements\n1. Latency:\n    Submission latency < 500ms\n    Execution delay < 10s\n\n2. Submissions should be hiighly available. \n    Executions are best effort\n\n3. The execution is eventual consistent.\n4. Scalable \n5. Extensible to run multiple language support\n\n\n400M DAU\n5 runs * 2 problems * 400M DAU = 10 * 400M / 100K = 40,000 rps\n\n\nCore entities\n\n1. Program\n2. Execution\n3. User\n\n\nAPIs\n\n1. POST /programs\nAUTH token\n\n{\n    program: {}\n}\n\n\n201: {\nprogram id\n}\n\n\n2. POST /programs/{programid}/executions\n{\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n2. GET /executions/{executionid}\n\n{\n    program_id,\n    execution_id,\n    stauts,\n    output\n    ...\n}\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional requirements\n1. Users should be able to run programs\n    Programs can be in various languages like python, C++, Java.\n\n2. System runs the program, report failures or success.\n-------\n3. Capture memory and time taken by the program and build histogram for users.\n\n\nNon functional requirements\n1. Latency:\n    Submission latency < 500ms\n    Execution delay < 10s\n\n2. Submissions should be hiighly available. \n    Executions are best effort\n\n3. The execution is eventual consistent.\n4. Scalable \n5. Extensible to run multiple language support\n\n\n400M DAU\n5 runs * 2 problems * 400M DAU = 10 * 400M / 100K = 40,000 rps\n\n\nCore entities\n\n1. Program\n2. Execution\n3. User\n\n\nAPIs\n\n1. POST /programs\nAUTH token\n\n{\n    program: {}\n}\n\n\n201: {\nprogram id\n}\n\n\n2. POST /programs/{programid}/executions\n{\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n2. GET /executions/{executionid}\n\n{\n    program_id,\n    execution_id,\n    stauts,\n    output\n    ...\n}\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
